<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>MINUSMA, 2015</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;MINUSMA&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; by Skjold &lt;EM&gt;(Sweden vs. Malian&amp;nbsp;Rebels)&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG alt=http://i.imgur.com/lGjvToB.jpg src="http://i.imgur.com/lGjvToB.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The Atrocities commited by the rebel groups in Mali's north has taken a turn for the worse. The UN has authorized airstrikes to support the Malian goverment in its push to once again retake the north of the country. To support the UN's mission in Mali, Sweden has deployed its fighter jets abroad for the first time since the Congo Crisis.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Mission&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;You are to employ airstrikes to weaken the rebels ability to wage an effective fight towards the goverment and you are to provide reconnissance support for the Malian goverment if requested. Collateral damage or friendly losses&amp;nbsp;will not be tolerated!&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
